      "widgets_values": [
        "A glossy black sports car is parked completely still on a vast dry lake bed.\n\nThe car remains completely stationary throughout the entire shot.\nThe wheels do not rotate and the vehicle does not move.\n\nThe camera moves slowly and smoothly straight forward toward the rear of the car.\nThe camera does not orbit around the vehicle and does not move sideways.\n\nThe car remains centered and geometrically stable.\nIts body shape, taillights, wheels and proportions remain unchanged.\n\nThe mountains, horizon and dry lake surface remain spatially stable.\nNatural perspective and subtle parallax only.\n\nNo lateral camera movement.\nNo orbit.\nNo rotation around the car.\nNo scene morphing.\nNo geometry distortion.\nNo background sliding.\n\nBright midday sunlight with realistic shadows.\n\nAudio: no dialogue, no human voice, no music.\nOnly gentle desert wind and a quiet engine idle.",
